{"root":{"data":{"id":"dhijt8zj7ts0","created":1775120815862,"text":"实验数据"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhijtg1kgzs0","created":1775120831222,"text":"第三章 竹硬炭","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijti6qk8w0","created":1775120835889,"text":"第四章 复合竹硬炭","layout_mind_offset":{"x":104,"y":-36},"layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhnava93bs0","created":1775029099963,"text":"（2）炭化温度-2","note":"这组可能是淹没后第二次系统做炭化温度\n但也可能是第一次\n统一是没有标签，用黑色马克笔直接标注在袋子上的\n所以可能是在学校的时候有一搭无一搭地做的\n时间可能在（1）炭化温度-1之前\n标注格式例如：985℃-2h-5Cpm\n不晓得温度是实际温度还是设定温度\n后面为了好看可能是都+15℃\neg：985℃当作1000℃\n同样是有非均匀点，不知道为什么总是这样\n原料应该也是没处理的竹\n？？？\n但也可能是竹颗粒，很大可能\n不不拿着就是第三次系统做炭化条件的\n第二次可能是YSCZNZC那批","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhhnm6xkteg0","created":1775029987324,"text":"未加热（通氩气）","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmc3xm3k0","created":1775029998592,"text":"985℃","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmc74o5s0","created":1775029998785,"text":"1185℃","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhijqlbjg680","created":1775120607617,"text":"SEM","progress":9,"layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijr9wpink0","created":1775120661140,"text":"TEM","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijrrdwvyo0","created":1775120699185,"text":"XRD","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijruljjx40","created":1775120706177,"text":"RAMAN","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijrxjp1hs0","created":1775120712595,"text":"XPS","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijs087xlc0","created":1775120718432,"text":"BET","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dhhnmcap5w00","created":1775029999001,"text":"1285℃","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dhijqlbjg680","created":1775120607617,"text":"SEM","progress":9,"layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijr9wpink0","created":1775120661140,"text":"TEM","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijrrdwvyo0","created":1775120699185,"text":"XRD","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dhijruljjx40",